Dear Players,

We are excited to announce that the Halloween Event has just begun and will last till November 9th.

During this period you may collect pumpkins to obtain tons of free coins and powerful rewards.
You may find the Halloween quests in the achievement screen:

Halloween Gloves - Collect 3000 pumpkins to get a powerful set of gloves;
Halloween Gift - Collect all the halloween skins to get a beautiful gift;
Pumpkins for Gold - Collect 500 pumpkins to get 1000 coins;
Powerful Extension - Transform into pumpkins and kill 100 players to get a powerful extension;

Thank you much for playing,
The Freakinware Team!

Dear Player, 

We are excited to announce that the Xmas Event has just begun and will last till January 7th. 

During this period you may collect candies to obtain tons of free coins and powerful rewards. 

You may find the Xmas quests in the achievement screen: 

Candies for gold - collect 500 candies to get 1000 coins;
Xmas Gift - collect 3000 candies to obtain the "Spirit Footwraps";
The Coins Multiplier - Transform into snowmen and kill 100 players to collect triple coins for 24hrs;
Powerful Extension - Transform into snowmen and kill 200 players to get a powerful extension;
Xmas Chest - Collect 12 xmas skins to get a Sapphire Chest.

Spirit Footwraps stats: Life 10%, Armor 7%, Speed 20%, Haste 9%.

Thank you for playing Strike.is and
Merry Christmas and Happy New Year! 

Strike.is Staff

Dear Player,

The new season has begun and you are already fighting to dominate the ranks.

We are excited to announce that the Halloween Event has just begun and will last till November 5th.

During this period you may collect pumpkins to obtain tons of free coins and powerful rewards.

You may find the Halloween quests in the achievement screen:
The Pumpkinfier - Collect 25 pumpkins to get the Pumpkinfier;
Slurpy Pumpkins - Eat 10 pumpkinfied players to obtain a powerful device;
Halloween Hat - Collect 3000 pumpkins to get a powerful hat;
Pumpkins for Gold - Collect 500 pumpkins to get 1000 coins;
Triple Coins For One Day - Trasform into pumpkins and kill 50 players to collect triple coins for 24hrs.

The current season ends on December 3rd.

Thank you much for playing,
The Freakinware Team!

